+    """The arm's RunSchedule under this recipe.  The formal steps must suit the plan file (a refresh at a multiple of
+    its checkpoint interval and before its last step) and the scaled ones this recipe (a refresh lands on a checkpoint,
+    which the refresh rollout reads, every step lies inside the run, the calibration comes before the first refresh, so a
